      "content": "If you are feeling that the only peace you can find is in the absence of feeling, it is incredibly important that you reach out to someone immediately. Please know that there are people who want to support you through this overwhelming pain. You can connect with the 988 Suicide & Crisis Lifeline by calling or texting 988 anytime. They are trained to listen without judgment and can help you navigate this crisis moment.",
